# Self-evaluation file (§ 16): what Blender usually exports.
# - vt / vn lines (scop skips them), faces written v/vt/vn and v//vn
# - object, group, smoothing and material lines (skipped)
# - not centred: the cube sits at x 2..4, so the centring card is needed
mtllib cube.mtl
o Cube
v 2.0 0.0 0.0
v 4.0 0.0 0.0
v 4.0 2.0 0.0
v 2.0 2.0 0.0
v 2.0 0.0 2.0
v 4.0 0.0 2.0
v 4.0 2.0 2.0
v 2.0 2.0 2.0
vt 0.0 0.0
vt 1.0 0.0
vt 1.0 1.0
vt 0.0 1.0
vn 0.0 0.0 1.0
vn 0.0 0.0 -1.0
vn 1.0 0.0 0.0
vn -1.0 0.0 0.0
vn 0.0 1.0 0.0
vn 0.0 -1.0 0.0
usemtl Material
s off
g sides
f 5/1/1 6/2/1 7/3/1 8/4/1
f 2/1/2 1/2/2 4/3/2 3/4/2
f 6/1/3 2/2/3 3/3/3 7/4/3
f 1//4 5//4 8//4 4//4
g caps
f 8/1/5 7/2/5 3/3/5 4/4/5
f 1/1/6 2/2/6 6/3/6 5/4/6
